msgid "Unknown source"
msgstr "未知來源"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:220
msgid "RTX Remix runs in this session through the native loader. Everything RTX lives in this tab."
msgstr "本次遊戲透過原生載入器執行 RTX Remix。與 RTX 相關的一切都在此分頁中。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:223
msgid "Open the RTX Remix guide"
msgstr "開啟 RTX Remix 指南"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:224
msgid "Memory and stability guide"
msgstr "記憶體與穩定性指南"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:225
msgid "Print the loader's status to the console"
msgstr "將載入器狀態輸出至主控台"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:226
msgid "Classic settings: the values of the original RTX install. They were applied once, only where a setting was still at its default. This button applies all of them again."
msgstr "經典設定：原始 RTX 安裝中的值。這些值已套用過一次，且只套用於當時仍為預設值的設定。此按鈕會再次套用所有這些值。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:227
msgid "Use the classic RTX settings"
msgstr "使用經典 RTX 設定"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:228
msgid "Keep add-ons from undoing RTX settings or drawing post-processing over the image"
msgstr "防止附加元件還原 RTX 設定，或在畫面上疊加後製效果"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:229
msgid "RTX session guard"
msgstr "RTX 工作階段保護"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:230
msgid "Turn this off only to test an add-on that misbehaves."
msgstr "僅在測試行為異常的附加元件時才關閉此項。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:231
msgid "Remix's own menu: press Alt+X. Choose Custom as the graphics preset before changing single settings, then use Save, or they come back at the next start."
msgstr "Remix 內建選單：按 Alt+X。變更個別設定前，請先將圖形預設設為「自訂」(Custom)，改完後使用「儲存」(Save)，否則下次啟動時這些設定會恢復原狀。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:232
msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:233
msgid "Same as Garry's Mod"
msgstr "與 Garry's Mod 相同"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:235
msgid "Language of this tab and the guide"
msgstr "此分頁與指南的語言"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:242
msgid "Changes here apply to this session. Use Save Settings in Alt+X to keep them. Values shown here are this panel's overrides, not a live readout of Remix."
msgstr "此處的變更在本次遊戲中生效。若要保留變更，請在 Alt+X 選單中儲存設定。這裡顯示的是本面板的覆寫值，並非 Remix 目前數值的即時顯示。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:243
msgid "Reapply these overrides at every launch"
msgstr "每次啟動時重新套用這些覆寫值"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:244
msgid "Leave this off to load Remix's saved settings. Turn it on only if you want this panel to override them."
msgstr "保持關閉即可載入 Remix 儲存的設定。只有希望本面板覆寫這些設定時，才開啟此選項。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:254
msgid "On"
msgstr "開啟"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:258
#, c-format
msgid "Set %s here"
msgstr "在此設定%s"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:284
msgid "Enable a numeric override before editing it. Zero is a valid value for sky brightness and colour purity."
msgstr "編輯數值前，請先啟用對應的覆寫選項。天空亮度和色彩純度皆可設為零。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:285
msgid "Clear this panel's overrides"
msgstr "清除本面板的覆寫值"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:289
msgid "Local player shadow"
msgstr "本機玩家陰影"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:290
msgid "Create your first-person body shadow and reflection. Other players and ragdolls are unaffected."
msgstr "在第一人稱視角下產生自身身體的陰影與反射，不影響其他玩家和布娃娃。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:291
msgid "Body height offset (units)"
msgstr "身體高度偏移（單位）"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:292
msgid "Positive values raise only the rendered body. Your camera and collision stay in place."
msgstr "正值只會抬高算繪出的身體，攝影機與碰撞位置維持不變。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:296
msgid "Keep toolgun text sharp"
msgstr "保持工具槍文字清晰"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:297
msgid "Draw the live toolgun screen at full resolution after upscaling. Animated and custom screens keep updating normally."
msgstr "在超解析度處理後，以完整解析度繪製工具槍螢幕的即時內容。動畫與自訂螢幕仍會正常更新。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:301
msgid "Hide outline meshes"
msgstr "隱藏描邊網格"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:302
msgid "Hides incompatible outline shells that can cover or darken the model. Other model materials keep their normal rendering."
msgstr "隱藏可能遮蓋模型或使模型變黑的異常描邊外殼。模型的其他材質仍會正常繪製。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:303
msgid "Imported game PBR"
msgstr "匯入角色的遊戲 PBR"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:304
msgid "Uses shipped Wuthering Waves, Endfield and Silver Palace maps. Preserves skin and faces. Off restores the original materials."
msgstr "使用鳴潮、終末地和白銀之城內附的貼圖，保留皮膚和臉部。關閉後還原原始材質。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:305
msgid "Steady eye whites for imported characters"
msgstr "匯入角色的穩定眼白"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:306
msgid "Recognizes named eye-white surfaces. Characters with a PBR pack keep its materials."
msgstr "辨識名稱明確的眼白表面。有 PBR 套件的角色保留套件內材質。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:307
msgid "Eye-white brightness"
msgstr "眼白亮度"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:308
msgid "Percent: 100 is the tuned default. Applies live to automatic eye whites and scene-adaptive eye emission in PBR packs. Zero removes that emission."
msgstr "百分比：100 為調校後的預設值。即時影響自動眼白和 PBR 套件中隨場景調整的眼部發光。零可關閉這部分發光。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:323
msgid "Player models"
msgstr "玩家模型"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:324
msgid "Toolgun screen"
msgstr "工具槍螢幕"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:325
msgid "Model outlines"
msgstr "模型描邊"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_motion_tab.lua:9
msgid "Motion importer"
msgstr "動作匯入工具"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_motion_tab.lua:11
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_motion_tab.lua:160
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_motion_tab.lua:196
msgid "Import VMD files and manage your motion library and playback."
msgstr "匯入 VMD 檔案，管理動作庫與播放。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_motion_tab.lua:74
msgid "Open in window"
msgstr "在視窗中開啟"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:390 nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:309
msgid "Choose eye-white materials"
msgstr "選擇眼白材質"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:394
msgid "Choose a spawned character, or look at one before opening this window. Choices are saved for this character and apply to all its copies, without respawning. The brightness and steady-eye-white settings still apply."
msgstr "選擇已生成的角色，或先看向角色再開啟此視窗。選擇依角色儲存，對其所有實例即時生效，無需重新生成。亮度和穩定眼白設定仍然適用。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:397
msgid "Choose a spawned character"
msgstr "選擇已生成的角色"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:400
msgid "Spawn a Model Hotloader character first. Only generated character textures can be selected."
msgstr "請先生成一個 Model Hotloader 角色。只能選擇角色匯入時產生的紋理。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:404
msgid "Previous materials"
msgstr "上一頁材質"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:405
msgid "Next materials"
msgstr "下一頁材質"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:416
msgid "Checked materials are eye whites. Use automatic detection removes a manual choice. A shared texture thumbnail can show the face too; only the selected material changes."
msgstr "勾選的材質將作為眼白。「使用自動辨識」可清除手動選擇。共用紋理的縮圖可能包含臉部；只有選中的材質會改變。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:459
msgid "Eye white"
msgstr "眼白"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:461
msgid "Use automatic detection"
msgstr "使用自動辨識"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:471
msgid "Chosen: eye white"
msgstr "手動：眼白"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:471
msgid "Chosen: ordinary material"
msgstr "手動：一般材質"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:473
msgid "Automatic: eye white"
msgstr "自動：眼白"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:473
msgid "Automatic: ordinary material"
msgstr "自動：一般材質"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:475
msgid "Generated texture unavailable"
msgstr "產生的紋理無法使用"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_eye_whites.lua:480
msgid "Choice could not be saved. The character may have been removed, or its saved choices were changed or are unreadable. Existing files have been kept."
msgstr "無法儲存選擇。角色可能已移除，或儲存的選擇已遭修改、無法讀取。現有檔案已保留。"
